{"Negative flusher count crashes - SpanFlusher uses max_processes directly to size process_to_shards_map and then indexes into it during shard assignment; a negative --flusher-processes value results in an empty map and a crash during initialization. The CLI option accepts any int and ProcessSpansStrategyFactory forwards it unvalidated, so a bad config can take down the consumer at startup.": 0.9214280247688293}